    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for visual effects applied to a series. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Effects are attached through the <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries_1a7c160bd8480b18303e574266397d66d3" kindref="member">PlotSeries::effects</ref></computeroutput> list and evaluated when the series renders. Each series supports some effects; assigning another logs a warning and the effect is ignored. Of several effects of one type, the first enabled one applies.</para>
<para><table rows="4" cols="2"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Effect  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Series  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GradientFill" kindref="compound">GradientFill</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GradientStroke" kindref="compound">GradientStroke</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Glow" kindref="compound">Glow</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries" kindref="compound">BarSeries</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1ErrorBarSeries" kindref="compound">ErrorBarSeries</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1FadeTrail" kindref="compound">FadeTrail</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GradientFill" kindref="compound">GradientFill</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1GradientStroke" kindref="compound">GradientStroke</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Glow" kindref="compound">Glow</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1FadeTrail" kindref="compound">FadeTrail</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PlotSeries" kindref="compound">PlotSeries</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
